          "caption": "黑白 135 负片、Instamatic 彩色负片与装框幻灯片的对照。水洗与保存条件针对不同片基材料。",
          "credit": "Friedrich Haag",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
          "source": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File%3A2015_04_08_009_Analogfilme.jpg"
